# Cassandra read-repair study rows (from reruns/study-cassandra-rr.rows, 2026-11-05 15:50), the instance groups q=2 blocking, q=2 none for the idle shared node brain09 (brain01's study-rr2 queue is starved by
# the 48-hour raft-rs rows of all-213352). Groups are self-contained (no needok across groups). Owner starts it:
#   ssh brain09 'cd /local/mkhoshechin/eval/daavar && bash scripts/start-shared-queue.sh cluster/campaign/shared/study-rr-brain09.rows'
